{"id":"1fa0c4e009de5637","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-binary-co-np.md","title":"Complexity Class coNP","display":"df-complexity-class-co-np — Complexity Class coNP","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-binary-co-np","aliases":["73-df-binary-co-np","73-df-complexity-class-co-np"],"display":"df-complexity-class-co-np — Complexity Class coNP","depends_on":["[[73-df-binary-np]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-binary-co-np"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-binary-co-np</span><span>73-df-complexity-class-co-np</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-complexity-class-co-np — Complexity Class coNP"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ebe5483ba604bc90\" href=\"?note=ebe5483ba604bc90\" title=\"73-df-binary-np\">73-df-binary-np</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NP}\">\\(\\mathsf{NP}\\)</span> (nondeterministic polynomial-time class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ebe5483ba604bc90\" href=\"?note=ebe5483ba604bc90\" title=\"73-df-binary-np\">73-df-binary-np</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complexity\\text{-}class\\text{-}co\\text{-}np}\\vdash\n\\overline L^{\\,\\mathbf 2^*}\\coloneqq\\mathbf 2^*\\setminus L,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{coNP}\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*:\\overline L^{\\,\\mathbf 2^*}\\in\\mathsf{NP}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complexity\\text{-}class\\text{-}co\\text{-}np}\\vdash\n\\overline L^{\\,\\mathbf 2^*}\\coloneqq\\mathbf 2^*\\setminus L,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{coNP}\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*:\\overline L^{\\,\\mathbf 2^*}\\in\\mathsf{NP}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The complement is explicitly relative to the fixed universe <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf 2^*\">\\(\\mathbf 2^*\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-binary-np","status":"resolved","id":"ebe5483ba604bc90","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-np]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-np","status":"resolved","id":"ebe5483ba604bc90","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{NP}$ (nondeterministic polynomial-time class, see [[73-df-binary-np]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{NP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complexity\\text{-}class\\text{-}co\\text{-}np}\\vdash\n\\overline L^{\\,\\mathbf 2^*}\\coloneqq\\mathbf 2^*\\setminus L,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{coNP}\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*:\\overline L^{\\,\\mathbf 2^*}\\in\\mathsf{NP}\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf 2^*","display":false}],"bytes":787,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["ebe5483ba604bc90"]}